// Optimizations compared to the baseline:
//  - Use column-major layout for A and Q to make columns contiguous.
//  - Express the outer (k) and inner (j) loops via Noarr traversers and
//    for_dims, so the whole loop nest is layout-agnostic and ready for
//    further tuning.
//  - For j-loops, use noarr::shift in traverser::order to restrict j to
//    (k+1 .. n-1) without extra branching, matching the original triangular
//    iteration space.
[[gnu::flatten, gnu::noinline]]
